      </p>
      <p>
        Using our <strong>refinance car loan calculator</strong> allows you to compare your remaining balance against a new loan offer. However, it is important to remember that a lower monthly payment does not automatically mean lower overall borrowing costs:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Extending the Loan Term:</strong> Stretching out your remaining months will reduce each monthly EMI, but may increase total interest over time.</li>
        <li><strong>Lowering the Interest Rate:</strong> Securing an interest rate reduction while keeping the remaining tenure the same creates genuine interest savings.</li>
        <li><strong>Refinancing Fees & Prepayment Charges:</strong> Factor in any loan processing fees, document charges, or foreclosure fees charged by your previous lender.</li>
      </ul>

