        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          A larger down payment reduces the initial loan amount you need to finance. This directly lowers your monthly EMI payment, decreases total interest paid over the loan term, and helps protect you against vehicle depreciation.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800">
